Rampart, whose own name is Viktor Kozlovsky, is an orc man of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] in the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]], which he serves in its regalia. He is a heavy, deliberate man, and magic does not touch him.

He was seen in a room of white walls and steel floor, watching a glass tube. Inside the tube a faint blue glow hung motionless while a reddish glow threw itself against the glass. [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] counts him a particular enemy, and once suspected him of holding the Kaathe [[People/Althane/Halidex Op-B|Hali]] and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]].
